    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n3356" root="بنى" body-key="b">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بِنْيَةٌ</span></b>  <i>A form, mode,</i> or <i>manner, of building</i> or
<i>framing</i> or <i>construction;</i> a word like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِشْيَةٌُ</span> and
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رِكْبَةٌ</span>. (T, TA.) [The <i>form,</i> or <i>mode of formation,</i> of a word.] <i>Natural constitution:</i> as in
the phrase, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فُلَانٌ صَحِيحُ البِنْيَةِ</span> [<i>Such a one is
sound in natural constitution</i>]. (S.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  See also
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بِنَآءٌ</span>.

